I Am Vanessa Guillen is a documentary film directed by Christy Wegener.

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Vanessa Guillen was 20 years old when she was found murdered at a US Army base.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Rather than submit to silence, her family fought for justice and change.

